`!`cReticulumPi Node`c

This node is running ReticulumPi with NomadNet page serving.

`=Welcome`=

This is a community Reticulum mesh node. Browse the pages below
or send an LXMF message to interact with this node's services.

>>Node Pages

  `[`:/page/status.mu`Node Status]  - Live system and network stats
  `[`:/page/help.mu`Help]           - Page editing and markup reference

>>Node Features

  - Heartbeat announcements on the Reticulum network
  - LXMF message echo responder
  - LXMF info bot (send !help for commands)
  - System monitoring (CPU, memory, disk, temperature)
  - NomadNet page and file serving
  - MeshChat web messaging UI
  - Transport hub auto-discovery
  - Mesh network topology mapping

>>Getting Started

Edit the .mu files in your pages directory to add your own content.
Place files in the files directory to make them available for download.

For micron markup reference, see the NomadNet documentation.

